WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.791
Tom walked along the path in the Dark Forest.

2
00:00:05.792 --> 00:00:15.226
The forest was spooky.

3
00:00:15.227 --> 00:00:53.117
"Where is the palace?" thought Tom.

4
00:00:53.118 --> 00:00:58.999
Tom saw a peddler.

5
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:04.037
"Do you know where the palace is?" asked Tom.

6
00:01:04.038 --> 00:01:07.328
"Yes," said the peddler.

7
00:01:07.329 --> 00:01:16.038
"It's where it always is, you fool!"

8
00:01:16.039 --> 00:01:21.499
"What a rude man," thought Tom.

9
00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:25.336
Tom walked some more.

10
00:01:25.337 --> 00:01:29.447
But he still did not see the palace.

11
00:01:29.448 --> 00:01:33.156
He pulled out the map.

12
00:01:33.157 --> 00:01:37.697
Suddenly a cold wind blew.

13
00:01:37.698 --> 00:01:41.170
"Brr!" Tom shivered.

14
00:01:41.171 --> 00:01:44.169
He reached into his sack.

15
00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:51.060
He found his mittens.

16
00:01:51.061 --> 00:01:57.124
But where was his fur hat?

17
00:01:57.125 --> 00:02:01.551
"I will make a new hat appear!" said Tom.

18
00:02:01.552 --> 00:02:04.776
He pointed his wand at his head.

19
00:02:04.777 --> 00:02:07.664
"Fur hat!" he said.

20
00:02:07.665 --> 00:02:23.532
Poof! Poof! Poof!

21
00:02:23.533 --> 00:02:28.052
Now something warm and furry sat on his head!

22
00:02:28.053 --> 00:02:32.594
"I did it!" Tom said proudly.

23
00:02:32.595 --> 00:02:36.364
Just then the cold wind blew again.

24
00:02:36.365 --> 00:02:39.334
The map flew out of Tom's hands!

25
00:02:39.335 --> 00:02:44.053
The map flew off the path and through the trees.

26
00:02:44.054 --> 00:02:47.097
Tom gulped.

27
00:02:47.098 --> 00:02:51.693
"Master said to stay on the path," thought Tom.

28
00:02:51.694 --> 00:02:54.645
"But I need that map!"

29
00:02:54.646 --> 00:03:02.174
Nervously Tom stepped off the path.

30
00:03:02.175 --> 00:03:10.640
He went deeper and deeper into the forest.

31
00:03:10.641 --> 00:03:14.534
Suddenly Tom stopped.

32
00:03:14.535 --> 00:03:16.948
"Huh?" he said.

33
00:03:16.949 --> 00:03:18.923
He felt his head.

34
00:03:18.924 --> 00:03:24.079
His fur hat was moving!

